  "instructions": [
    "preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "season the sea bass fillets with salt, black pepper, and dill on both sides.",
    "grill the sea bass for 3-4 minutes per side, or until it reaches an internal temperature of 145°f.",
    "while the sea bass is grilling, combine lemon juice, olive oil, garlic, and fennel in a small bowl.",
    "brush the mixture on the grilled sea bass during the last minute of cooking.",
    "remove the sea bass from the grill and top with unsalted butter.",
    "drizzle the lemon juice mixture on top of the sea bass.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
